From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] util.h: make VERSION and progname extern declarations

Upstream util.h defines two non-static global variables. GNU ld silently
deduplicates them, but the OHOS lld toolchain rejects the duplicate symbols.
Promote the header definitions to extern declarations and define progname in
util.c.
---
 src/util.c | 1 +
 src/util.h | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/util.c b/src/util.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/util.c
+++ b/src/util.c
@@ -15,1 +15,2 @@
+const char *progname = "";
 const char *VERSION = "2.2.0";
diff --git a/src/util.h b/src/util.h
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/src/util.h
+++ b/src/util.h
@@ -14,2 +14,2 @@
-const char *VERSION;
-const char *progname;
+extern const char *VERSION;
+extern const char *progname;
--
2.39.1
